# Relay board restyle (pending remount)

The Relay swap widget was removed in `#362` pending a foundation API key. Packages stay in `package.json`. Do **not** remount it unless that key is in and someone asked to bring the widget back.

When it comes back, apply the existing board kit. Do not restyle from scratch or restore the old ink-kit CSS.

## Kit

- `src/app/[locale]/_components/HomeBoard/relay-board.ts` — remount steps
- `relay-board-theme.ts` — pass `relayBoardTheme` to `RelayKitProvider`
- `relay-board.css` — already imported from `HomeBoard.tsx`
- `src/util/relay-kit-theme.ts` — old `theme` import still works

## Required wiring

1. Restore `RelayProvider` inside `WalletProvider`. Theme = `relayBoardTheme`.
2. Restore `RelayKitUI` / `useAdaptedWallet` from `7418aca^`. Keep `bridge__history`.
3. Do **not** restore `RelayKitUI.css` (ink-kit tokens fight the board). Keep `@reservoir0x/relay-kit-ui/styles.css`.
4. Mount in the `/bridge` overlay **before** the bridges list:

```tsx
<section className="col col--relay" data-name="relay">
  <div className="bridge__inner">
    <div className="col__top">
      <span className="pill pill--glass">{t("bridgeCta")}</span>
    </div>
    <div className="bridge__widget relay-board">
      <RelayKitUI />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

5. Drop `col--catalog` from the bridges column so it is the narrow side list again. The kit restores the 943 / 242 split when `.col--relay` is present.

Further restyle only in `relay-board.css` and `relay-board-theme.ts`.
